/-! # The row maximum against the extended reals

The lane's maximum over its 32 columns (`Gen.rmax`, pcs 516-565): the sixteen sum pairs are folded
by `max.ftz`, in two halves joined at pc 564, and the maximum is multiplied by the scale (`%r9`,
a positive real). With the sums as `w0SumV (S c) (S (c+1))` the result reads as
`sc * sup_c S c`. Generated by `Gen/w0num_row_gen.py`. -/

